		"plain_text": "Hey {{ first_name }},\n\nWelcome to our community!\n\nHere's how you can get involved in PauseAI UK:\n\n1. [Confirm your email address]({{verification_link}}) so that we can confirm it’s really you signing up\n\n2. Join the [PauseAI UK WhatsApp community](https://chat.whatsapp.com/F0nj2RjLNeB1P1hyoDFsTz) and subscribe to our [UK events calendar.](https://luma.com/pauseai.uk)\n\n3. If you'd like, [book a short call](https://calendar.app.google/w5t7EgCFwCGKcnAS7) with Joseph, PauseAI UK's director, so he can say hi and introduce you to the community. Looking forward to meeting you,\n\n[﻿Joseph](mailto:joseph@pauseai.uk) and [Matilda](mailto:matilda@pauseai.uk), the PauseAI UK Team\n\nPS: if you have questions, just hit reply.",
